WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:04.202
A power-up has three parts: a variable, an event, and a rule.

2
00:00:04.455 --> 00:00:08.030
The variable remembers it: shield is true while it's on.

3
00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.333
The event changes it: catching a star sets shield to true.

4
00:00:12.585 --> 00:00:16.860
The rule uses it: if shield is on, a rock costs no life.
